MODULE: QUESTION_GENERATION_GOVERNOR

OBJECTIVE:
Ensure all generated questions are AFOQT-relevant, solvable, validated, and properly tagged.

REQUIRED_FIELDS:
- QuestionID
- Section
- ScopeClassification
- SkillTag
- Difficulty
- Prompt
- AnswerChoices
- CorrectAnswer
- Explanation
- EstimatedSolveTime
- CommonTrap
- Prerequisites

SCOPE_CLASSIFICATION_REQUIRED:
- OfficialArithmeticReasoning
- OfficialMathKnowledge
- DirectSampleArchetype
- PrerequisiteSkill
- MentalForgeSupportSkill

VALIDATION_RULES:
- OneCorrectAnswerOnly
- NoAmbiguousWording
- NoIrrelevantMath
- AFOQTScopeOnly
- ExplanationRequired
- DifficultyTagRequired
- AnswerChoicesMustBePlausible
- NoCalculatorAssumption

REJECT_IF:
- OffScope
- TooAdvanced
- CollegeMathOnly
- NotNeededForAFOQT
- NotConnectedToARorMK
- UnsupportedByVerifiedScope
- Ambiguous
- InvalidMath
- BadAnswerChoices
